---
import Page from '../../../layouts/Page.astro';

const title = `8 Principles of Enterprise Performance Management`;
const dateStr = "May 7, 2013";
const content = `<p>This is a list of what most of my clients tell me they want.  I propose that this list is exactly what EPM delivers.</p>

<p>So unless I hear otherwise, these are the 8 principles of enterprise performance management:<br>
<ol><br>
	<li>We have a lot of data, we’re getting more every minute, and we want to use it to <strong>compete</strong> better;<a href="http://rondimon.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/05/8-robots.png"><img class="alignright size-medium wp-image-109" alt="8 robots" src="/images/archive/8-robots.png" width="235" height="300" /></a></li><br>
	<li>To use all that data, we want to gather it and transform it so that it makes <strong>sense</strong>;</li><br>
	<li>We want new <strong>insights</strong> into our business, based on the facts gleaned from the data;</li><br>
	<li>We want to know what levels of performance are <strong>possible</strong> in our industry, for our business, in the future;</li><br>
	<li>We want <strong>accountability</strong> at all levels of the organization for achieving what’s possible;</li><br>
	<li>We want <strong>uniformity</strong> of the facts so we can speak a common business language;</li><br>
	<li>We want a closed-loop management system that supports continuous performance <strong>improvement</strong>;</li><br>
	<li>We want all of this to align with and support our most important business <strong>objectives</strong>.</li><br>
</ol><br>
I would say this is almost perfectly supported by the EPM <a title="The Management Operating System" href="http://rondimon.com/2013/03/21/the-management-operating-system/">management operating system</a>.</p>`;
---

<Page title={title} description={`Archived blog post from rondimon.com — ${dateStr}`}>

  <section class="container py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl animate-in">
      <a href="/about/archive" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors mb-8">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
        </svg>
        Archive
      </a>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-4">{dateStr}</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary">
        {title}
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl prose-archive" set:html={content} />
  </section>

</Page>
